A clip that did not play waits for a freeze to end.

The wait after a clip that did not play (patch 0031) fetched the clip again
when it ended, before it looked whether the card was frozen. Under the page's
pause that was a fetch and a decode while the member was away; under a lock
alone the clip then showed and played, an automatic clip under the lock. A
wait that ends while the card is frozen now does nothing and is held; it
starts again when the freeze ends, so that a pet the resume leaves as it is
(asleep) still goes on, while a clip the resume picks takes over from it.

